    <preface>
      <p><b>Homeless Persons Assistance Amendment Act 1979</b></p>
      <p><b>No. 130 of 1979</b></p>
      <p>An Act to amend the <i>Homeless Persons Assistance Act </i>1974.</p>
      <p>BE IT ENACTED by the Queen, and the Senate and House of Representatives of the Commonwealth of Australia, as follows:</p>
      <p><b>Short title, &amp;c.</b></p>
    </preface>
    <body>
      <section eId="sec-1">
        <num>1</num>
        <subsection eId="sec-1__subsec-1">
          <num>1</num>
          <content>
            <p><b>1.</b><b> </b>(1) This Act may be cited as the <i>Homeless Persons Assistance Amendment Act </i>1979.</p>
          </content>
        </subsection>
        <subsection eId="sec-1__subsec-2">
          <num>2</num>
          <content>
            <p>(2) The <i>Homeless Persons Assistance Act </i>1974 is in this Act referred to as the Principal Act.</p>
          </content>
        </subsection>
      </section>
      <section eId="sec-2">
        <num>2</num>
        <heading>Commencement</heading>
        <content>
          <p><b>2. </b>This Act shall come into operation on the day on which it receives the Royal Assent.</p>
        </content>
      </section>
      <section eId="sec-3">
        <num>3</num>
        <heading>Title</heading>
        <content>
          <p><b>3.</b> The title of the Principal Act is amended by omitting ‘Australia’ and substituting ‘the Commonwealth’.</p>
        </content>
      </section>
      <section eId="sec-4">
        <num>4</num>
        <heading>Interpretation</heading>
        <content>
          <p><b>4</b><b>.</b><b> </b>Section 3 of the Principal Act is amended by omitting the definition of ‘prescribed period’.</p>
        </content>
      </section>
      <section eId="sec-5">
        <num>5</num>
        <heading>Approval of projects</heading>
        <content>
          <p><b>5.</b> Section 4 of the Principal Act is amended by omitting from paragraph (a) ‘during the prescribed period,’ and substituting ‘at any time after the commencement of this Act,’.</p>
        </content>
      </section>
      <section eId="sec-6">
        <num>6</num>
        <heading>Grants in respect of rent of premises</heading>
        <content>
          <p><b>6. </b>Section 6 of the Principal Act is amended by omitting ‘the prescribed period,’ and substituting ‘a period after the commencement of this Act,’.</p>
        </content>
      </section>
      <section eId="sec-7">
        <num>7</num>
        <heading>Grants in respect of fixtures, &amp;c.</heading>
        <content>
          <p><b>7. </b>Section 7 of the Principal Act is amended by omitting ‘the prescribed period,’ and substituting ‘a period after the commencement of this Act,’.</p>
        </content>
      </section>
